Here are some C programs written as coding exercises.  The mechanism for invoking googletest unit tests is copied from Mike Long's work at

https://github.com/meekrosoft

The files called *_test.cc will not compile without a copy of the googletest sources placed at the path GTEST_DIR:

GTEST_DIR = $(HOME)/gitsrc/googletest/googletest

googletest is available at git@github.com:google/googletest.git

The C/C++ code is my own work except where noted otherwise.
